  <wsdl:operation
name="mosObj">

  <documentation
xmlns="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/wsdl/">mosObj Contains
information that describes a unique MOS Object to the NCS. The NCS uses this
information to search for and reference the MOS Object. Profile 1 required MOS
message support</documentation> 

